Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}股票与债券水涨船高…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Stocks and bonds are moving higher...{\r}
